Description: Windows NT 4.0-style desktop shell for labwc
 Daytona recreates the Windows NT 4.0 desktop on Wayland: a taskbar with
 Start button, Start menu, window buttons, notification area (tray icons and
 balloons) and clock, a desktop with NT wallpaper modes, and NT's Run, Shut
 Down, Taskbar Properties and Display Properties dialogs. labwc provides the
 window management, configured with NT key bindings, window menu and theme.
 .
 The package also contains the "daytona" Qt 6 style, which gives other Qt 6
 Widgets applications the NT look, and daytona-themetool, which applies
 Windows 95/NT/Plus! .theme colour schemes to the shell, Qt and GTK 3
 applications and labwc. A "Daytona" session is installed for login managers.

Package: daytona-chicago95
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Chicago95 GTK theme, icons and cursors for Daytona
 Chicago95 is a Windows 95 look for GTK, with matching icon and cursor
 themes. Daytona uses its icons and cursors throughout and applies its GTK 3
 theme, in the current Daytona colour scheme, to GTK 3 applications.
 .
 This package contains the Chicago95 GTK 2/3 theme, the Chicago95 icon theme
 and the "Chicago95 Standard Cursors" cursor theme, as pinned by Daytona.
